    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380-a10">

                <pb facs="0646" n="1606" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1606"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10 in No.
                    112.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Said Pasha to Mr. King.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Sublime Porte,<lb/>Ministry of Foreign
                            Affairs</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 15,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’affaires</hi>: I have the honor to
                    remind you of my note of the 16th of August last, and to request you to be kind
                    enough, in conformity to the demand contained therein, to have Proios appear as
                    soon as possible before the commission charged by the international council of
                    health to examine his affair.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Said.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
